# Petty Cash Fund
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Petty Cash — an imprest fund: a fixed float, one accountable Custodian
# Case 6 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# Grounded in the imprest-fund control pattern: fixed float, single custodian,
# independent reconciliation by someone other than the custodian.

Petty Cash Fund

Fields

- Fund Name : Text
- Custodian : User
- Fixed Imprest Amount : Money
- Current Balance : Money
- Status : Active | Inactive

Constraints

- Fund Name is required.
- Custodian is required.
- Fixed Imprest Amount is required.

Permissions

Custodian

- View

Auditor

- View

Views

- Fund Form : Form
- Fund List : List
- Fund Detail : Detail
